# Wayfarer's Rest, by Gemini 3.8 Flash & SZ. A slow, wistful fantasy RPG theme for the Chiptune
# style: a singing pulse lead, rolling pulse-arp broken chords, walking triangle bass, and an
# answering square counter-melody in D Dorian at dusk.
title: Wayfarer's Rest
composer: Gemini 3.8 Flash & SZ
about: A wistful fantasy RPG theme at dusk: singing pulse lead, rolling broken chords, walking triangle bass, and an answering square counter-melody.
